B.Pz=new A.cg("D. KEEL",1,"PROBATIONARY","Did not come back for a second shift. Left the badge on the desk.","THE CANTEEN opens.")
B.PF=new A.cg("M. ARDEN",2,"NIGHT OPERATOR","Resigned by telephone, at 06:04, from a call box outside.","THE FILE \u2014 one document recovered from the desk every night.")
B.Pn=new A.cg("S. BRIGHT",4,"OPERATOR, SECOND CLASS","Transferred to daytime. Would not say why in writing.","THE STATION BOARD \u2014 permanent upgrades bought with RATINGS POINTS.")
B.Ps=new A.cg("R. OKONKWO",7,"OPERATOR, FIRST CLASS","Took the annual leave he was owed and did not use the return half.","THE TOOL RACK \u2014 charged equipment on the Q-T row.")
B.Pv=new A.cg("J. FENN",11,"SENIOR OPERATOR","Signed off every morning for eleven days and then simply did not sign on.","AUTOMATION \u2014 the bots on the AUTO tab.")
B.Pq=new A.cg("A. VOSS",16,"DUTY OPERATOR","Requested a second operator in writing four times. Filed the refusals in date order.","A ninth key. It is not on the deck yet.")
B.PE=new A.cg("P. LARSSON",23,"SHIFT SUPERVISOR","Kept a tally on the underside of the desk. It stops at 23.",null)
B.Pw=new A.cg("E. MARSH",32,"DUTY SUPERVISOR",'Wrote "IT IS NOT THE NOISE" on the wall behind the rack. It is still there.',null)
B.Pp=new A.cg("C. IVERS",45,"TRANSMISSION CONTROLLER","Stopped using the corridor. Slept in the booth for the last three weeks of it.",null)
B.Px=new A.cg("B. NAKASHIMA",62,"SENIOR CONTROLLER","Asked the day staff to stop leaving him notes. They had not been leaving him notes.",null)
B.Po=new A.cg("T. GRUBER",84,"CHIEF OPERATOR","Logged every hour of every shift. The last forty entries are in someone else's hand.",null)
B.Pu=new A.cg("W. ODELL",112,"DUTY ENGINEER","Climbed the mast once. Would not say what the handholds were.",null)
B.Pl=new A.cg("N. PRYCE",150,"SENIOR ENGINEER","Requested the booth window be bricked up. The request was approved and never carried out.",null)
B.PD=new A.cg("F. AMANI",200,"TRANSMISSION ENGINEER","Two hundred nights without a single missed quota. No note, no resignation, no last shift.",null)
B.Pk=new A.cg("K. SOLT",268,"STATION ENGINEER","Started signing the book with the previous operator's name. Nobody corrected him.",null)
B.Pt=new A.cg("H. VANCE",355,"DUTY MANAGER","The only one who ever turned the carrier down. For nine seconds.",null)
B.PA=new A.cg("G. REEDY",470,"NIGHT MANAGER","Left a full flask and a coat on the back of the chair. Both are still there.",null)
B.Pr=new A.cg("L. ASHE",620,"SENIOR NIGHT MANAGER","Stopped appearing in the day staff's accounts of the handover, while continuing to attend it.",null)
B.Py=new A.cg("V. CORRIGAN",810,"CONTROLLER OF TRANSMISSION","Answered the phone in the booth. There is no phone in the booth.",null)
B.PC=new A.cg("O. STRAND",1000,"DEPUTY CHIEF","A thousand nights. The card in the vault has his face on it.",null)
B.Pm=new A.cg("I. BRENNAN",1080,"CHIEF OF TRANSMISSION","Wrote the memos. Signed the refusals. Sat the post himself for the last eleven weeks of it.",null)
B.PB=new A.cg("R. HALLORAN",1114,"THE LONGEST NIGHT","Did not sign off on the morning of the 1,115th. The carrier was up. The chair was warm.","There is nobody left on the roster above you.")
